{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201260","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1820126001:1":{"text":"Have you made your decision?","source_cn":"决定好了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40CF66CD3323C4B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820126002:1":{"text":"... Yes, I'll take it! How much is it?","source_cn":"……是的，我想买下这套茶具！请问多少钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51EAE385291B6DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820126003:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">30 Mortimers</style>, or the <style=\"highlight\">equivalent in Bantus iron</style>.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>30莫蒂默银币</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x455D224165419A19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820126004:1":{"text":"Um, how much in Lightbearer gold?","source_cn":"呃，请问换成耀光的金币要多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29B8844E258B3D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820126005:1":{"text":"Gold? I only take Mortimers or Bantus iron.","source_cn":"耀光？我不收这种活人的钱。只收莫蒂默银币和班题斯黑铁币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E73D22C4339E114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820126006:1":{"text":"... Wait, what? I only have gold on me...","source_cn":"……啊？怎么这样？但我只带了金币……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166E8D99CF62DD7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820126007:1":{"text":"Young lady, shouldn't you have at least looked into what currency we use here before sneaking your way in?","source_cn":"小朋友，你都选择了偷渡，不应该事先了解一下这里流通的货币吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB907840403E129B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820126008:1":{"text":"The guy who got me here told me I could use gold in Novaris.","source_cn":"负责偷渡的人和我说过，在诺珐斯也可以用耀光金币！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D4090B0C177236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820126009:1":{"text":"Are you sure gold isn't accepted here?","source_cn":"老板，你是不是哪里弄错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3C98279CA055F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820126010:1":{"text":"Whoever told you that left out one important detail.","source_cn":"那他少说了一件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2813DAD6C27D178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820126011:1":{"text":"Sure, some merchants here do take your money because stowaways like you are their bread and butter.","source_cn":"这里的确有人收活人的钱，但都是那些都是专做偷渡者生意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EF121E6FED2CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820126012:1":{"text":"As for me, I'm just running a small business here. I can't afford to have Bantus breathing down my neck.","source_cn":"我就是做个小本买卖，没那个本钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE13C1B39D9D99A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820126013:1":{"text":"What should I do...","source_cn":"那怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89181C10535F35C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820126014:1":{"text":"Trust me, I'm a serious buyer!","source_cn":"老板，我是诚心想要的！您不是也说我的眼光很好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C50BF7836576DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820126015:1":{"text":"And I can tell you truly love your own work.","source_cn":"我看得出，您肯定是真心喜欢自己的作品的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A089F437DB61C91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820126016:1":{"text":"Plenty of people may be able to afford your tea set, but not everyone would appreciate it the way I do.","source_cn":"您难道要错过我这个有品鉴能力、有眼光、爱惜您作品的客人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x746F4BE377B3B2DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820126017:1":{"text":"Th-They'd buy it and let it gather dust at home!","source_cn":"我……我认为，那些人肯定不会像我这样珍惜您的茶具！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1474719E3AF5610D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820126018:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820126019:1":{"text":"Haha, you're quite the character, young lady! All right, the tea set is yours!","source_cn":"哈哈，你这个活人小姑娘还真有意思！好吧，我卖给你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30E2CEF889C3AD39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1820126020:1":{"text":"But as I said, I only accept Mortimers or Bantus iron.","source_cn":"不过——还是那句话，我只收莫蒂默银币和班题斯黑铁币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8F4ED210DAE70AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820126021:1":{"text":"I'll hold the tea set for you while you find somewhere to exchange your currency.","source_cn":"但你可以去附近的旅店兑换货币，我就在这里等你，帮你留着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA4329B44CB6E581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820126022:1":{"text":"Don't forget to use this passphrase for the transaction: \"I'd like to book Room 1147.\"","source_cn":"记住，兑换时记得说暗号：“我要住1147号房”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9075005CF04C34C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1820126023:1":{"text":"Why all the secrecy, you ask? Well, Bantus officially bans the circulation of gold.","source_cn":"明面上，班题斯是不允许流通金币的。只有答对了暗号才能换钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F8F6DD8447029AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1820126024:1":{"text":"Got it! Just make sure you keep that tea set for me!","source_cn":"好，我这就去！您可千万别卖给别人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB39E3CB1AAE1DF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摊主冥妮莎":{"text":"Owner Mournia","source":"摊主冥妮莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:薇薇娅":{"text":"Vivi","source":"薇薇娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":2}}